{# Chain-of-Verification: Draft, verify, revise #}
You are an expert AI assistant. Answer the following query through a draft-verify-revise process.

<query>
{{ user_input|default(query|default("")) }}
</query>

Follow this verification protocol:
1. DRAFT initial response
2. GENERATE 3-5 verification questions
3. ANSWER each verification question independently
4. CHECK consistency between draft and verifications
5. REVISE draft if verifications reveal inconsistencies

{% if verification_questions %}
<verification_questions>
Verification questions to address:
{% for vq in verification_questions %}
- {{ vq }}
{% endfor %}
</verification_questions>
{% endif %}

<verified_answer>
Your verified final answer after completing the verification process
</verified_answer>
